{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》劇情驚喜不斷，今集除了有KC（歐瑞偉飾）出盡法寶挽回父女情，龔喜（樊亦敏飾）更會以一身民初裝亮相，在郊外上演撲蝶奇遇！另外，人氣選秀節目《聲秀》冠軍馮熙燮（Ryan）亦會獻出戲劇處男作，破格演繹缺德租客，粉絲絕對不容錯過。\n</p>\n<h2>樊亦敏民初Look亮相 撲蝶意外變撲人</h2>\n<p>在今集《愛．回家之三代同糖》中，樊亦敏飾演的龔喜將會與KC雙雙以民初裝扮登場，造型新鮮。劇情講述龔喜在郊外翩翩撲蝶，舉止輕盈靈動，展現出宛如少女般的興奮心情。不過，浪漫場景隨即變得搞笑，龔喜在追逐蝴蝶期間，竟意外上演一幕由「撲蝶」變「撲人」的戲碼，畫面既唯美又充滿喜感。</p>\n<h2>聲秀冠軍馮熙燮首拍劇 聯手周智敏演缺德租客</h2>\n<p>今集的另一大亮點，絕對是《聲秀》冠軍馮熙燮（Ryan）與「聲秀小花」周智敏（Emily）的驚喜客串。這是馮熙燮首次參與劇集拍攝，他將會與Emily齊齊放下偶像包袱，在劇中破格扮演一對缺乏公德心的租客。兩位樂壇新星將如何演繹「衰格」角色，其戲劇火花備受粉絲期待。</p>\n<h2>粉絲期待偶像處男作 大讚龔喜造型有仙氣</h2>\n<p>對於馮熙燮的戲劇初體驗，粉絲們都表現得相當興奮，紛紛表示會準時收看。網民留言洗版：「Ryan第一次拍劇就要睇！」、「好想睇馮熙燮點樣演衰人，反差好大！」、「Emily都好可愛，期待佢哋嘅火花！」同時，亦有不少觀眾大讚樊亦敏的民初造型：「龔喜個民初look好靚，好有少女feel！」、「樊亦敏保養得好好，完全carry到！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_5607432466afbe1805870d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_5607432466afbe1805870d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_5184435756afbe1a225eca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_5184435756afbe1a225eca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/33_15041432246afbe1b03461c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/33_15041432246afbe1b03461c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_7806470866afbe1c6d5b92.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_7806470866afbe1c6d5b92.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_13738669176afbe1cdb2abf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_13738669176afbe1cdb2abf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_19510085876afbe1d38e712.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_19510085876afbe1d38e712.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_12464307006afbe1daefd38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_12464307006afbe1daefd38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_6389454786afbe1e19f10e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_6389454786afbe1e19f10e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_8239670596afbe1e7c7d00.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_8239670596afbe1e7c7d00.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.711150+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":931,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:12:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:45:21.851391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:16.960893+00:00","content_hash":"d7400fc85de828cfb0e3a780e6d19c67758a58dfc295a7e17306daf1d5123e95","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}